message: "If you use GIANI in your work, please cite both the software and the associated publication (see preferred-citation)."
title: "GIANI: General Image Analysis of Nuclei-containing Images"
abstract: >-
  GIANI is a FIJI/ImageJ plugin for automated batch analysis of 3D
  microscopy images. It reads proprietary image formats, segments nuclei
  and cells, measures morphology and fluorescence intensity, and provides
  a browser for exploring the results.
